SDV simple:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:150ms+/-10ms; offset:0ms+/-0ms, DL: 30ms+/-10ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 100ms+/-1ms; offset:0ms+/-0ms, AD: 30ms+/-10ms)    
App :
    Component AEB_controler :
        Service S1:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera
            publish to VSS signal Brake
            triggered on Camera
            execution 50ms+/-15ms

Functional Chains:
    chain : Camera -> S1 -> Brake